MODULE: WorkConservingRefusalWaitIgnoresFreePermit
TARGET: WorkConservingRefusal
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the wait arm refuses on its stale observation while a permit is free and no waiter is ahead
PERTURBS: RefuseWait

--- FIND
RefuseWait(r) ==
    /\ status[r] = "pending" /\ RefuseForWait(r)
--- REPLACE
RefuseWait(r) ==
    /\ status[r] = "pending"
    /\ role[r] # "Drive" /\ observed[r].depth > 0 /\ observed[r].drain = "WaitExceeded"
--- END